# Flat review repository — intentionally permissive.
#
# This repo is a flat, review-only snapshot (see FLAT_LAYOUT_EXPLAINED.md), so
# almost nothing is ignored: raw evidence GeoJSON, processed tables, fitted
# models and the Chinese audit pack are all committed on purpose so a reviewer
# or AI agent can read the whole project from one directory listing.
#
# Only local scratch produced by the restore helpers and OS/editor junk are
# ignored.

# Output of RESTORE_STRUCTURE.ps1 / RESTORE_STRUCTURE.py
_restored/

# OS / editor junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
